  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : $\\int_{-1}^4 f(x) d x=4$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& 3(4-2)-\\int_2^4 f(x) d x=7 \\\\\n& \\int_2^4 f(x) d x=-1 \\\\\n& \\int_{-1}^2 f(x) d x=\\int_{-1}^4 f(x) d x+\\int_4^2 f(x) d x=4-\\int_2^4 f(x) d x=4-(-1)=5\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
